    "body": "Which of the following series are conditionally convergent? \n$(i) \\sum_{n=1}^{\\infty} (-1)^n (\\frac{1}{2})^n \\\\\n(ii) \\sum_{n=1}^{\\infty} (-1)^n (\\frac{1}{\\sqrt{n}}) \\\\\n(iii) \\sum_{n=1}^{\\infty} (-1)^n (\\frac{1}{ln(n)})$",
